  "body": "As per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3499#issuecomment-368037025, I’d like to propose an enhancement for #3499 such that its `:heading(n)` CSS pseudo-class accepts range expressions `:heading(> n)`, `:heading(< n)`, `:heading(>= n)`, `:heading(<= n)`, and perhaps simple conjunctions such as `:heading(> m, < n)`. See also #83 and w3c/csswg-drafts#1008.",
